// Password Protected ZIP File Opened (Suspicious Filenames) | T1027, T1036, T1105 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_security_susp_opened_encrypted_zip_filename.yml
winlog.channel:Security AND ((event.code:5379 AND winlog.event_data.TargetName:*Microsoft_Windows_Shell_ZipFolder\:filename*) AND (winlog.event_data.TargetName:(*invoice* OR *new\ order* OR *rechnung* OR *factura* OR *delivery* OR *purchase* OR *order* OR *payment*)))
